Earlier code (2023)

The logq library is a new implementation written in 2026. It generalises the
approach of the original 2023 code by Paweł Gepner, Leonid Moroz,
Volodymyr Samotyy, Zbigniew Kokosiński, Nataliia Gavkalova and
Bartłomiej Kocot. That code is kept unchanged in baselines/legacy/ for
reference and comparison and is distributed under its own copyright notice
(baselines/legacy/LICENSE).

Third-party code

The other files in baselines/ are third-party code used only for comparison
and are NOT part of the logq library; each keeps its own licence (see
baselines/README.md).
